      "notes": "Write-capable MCP route that builds the repo code index for a configured workspace repository, writing only to an ignored cache path. The build is dirty-safe: the base index is built from HEAD's committed objects, so a dirty worktree no longer refuses the build (it reports dirty_state: dirty_worktree but still succeeds, and read-only impact/context queries merge the working-tree overlay on top). The cache path must still be git-ignored or the build refuses with cache_path_not_ignored. Run to refresh the base cache after a commit, merge, rebase, or structural change. CLI fallback: `npm run wiki -- code-index build --json --dir <repo>`."
